          "description": "A first visit at Livewell Dental includes health-history review, a complete oral exam, digital records as needed, discussion with Dr. Chris, and a personalized plan for next steps.",
          "name": "New Patient Dental Exam",
          "provider": {
            "@id": "https://www.livewelldentalva.com/#organization"
